OL,3,GNEWSAYoung striker backs city's
OL,4,Aanti-vaping campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told those taking part that he had
OL,7,Fnever vaped and would most likely not
OL,8,Fhave had a career in professional sport
OL,9,Fif he had: "I think if I ever touched a
OL,10,Fvape, knowing how addictive it can be
OL,11,Fand how addicted my mates are to it,
OL,12,FI'd probably say I wouldn't be where I
OL,13,Fam now."
